WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.899 --> 00:00:01.440
Finally,

1
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.660
let's review the steps to create a case.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.350
Add notes and then close the case to thoroughly document the interaction.

3
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.800
Navigate to the new inquiry panel from

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.500
within the newly created prospective member record.

5
00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:19.620
Create a new case using programs and services as the type,

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.239
and EMSU as the subtype.

7
00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:24.319
Then click Add Next

8
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:26.459
and done to finish creating the case.

9
00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:31.399
A new case will open with an in progress status and will be given a case number.

10
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.389
Next,

11
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.560
add case notes.

12
00:00:34.069 --> 00:00:35.770
In the notes section of the case,

13
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:38.299
select the option to add a new note.

14
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.290
Then add details in the body text field.

15
00:00:41.669 --> 00:00:42.610
Keep your notes simple.

16
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:43.709
For example,

17
00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:46.009
transferred caller to EMSU.

18
00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:47.630
After adding your note,

19
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.130
click done to save it to the case record.

20
00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:51.150
Finally,

21
00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.189
close the case using the Close case action button

22
00:00:54.189 --> 00:00:56.209
in the upper right corner of the screen.

23
00:00:56.549 --> 00:00:58.229
In the resolution reason pop-up,

24
00:00:58.549 --> 00:00:59.930
choose Call Transferred,

25
00:01:00.189 --> 00:01:01.389
then click Close.

26
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:04.260
The case will be closed and the unknown

27
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:07.300
call will be documented as transferred to EMSU.